### Component 2: Backend API Endpoints

#### [NEW] [pos.controller.ts](file:///Volumes/Drive/Projects/BitBucket/infi-commerce/backend/src/controllers/pos.controller.ts)

pos-specific API endpoints:
- `POST /api/pos/session/start` - Start a new pos session
- `POST /api/pos/session/end` - End pos session with cash count
- `GET /api/pos/session/current` - Get current active session
- `GET /api/pos/session/history` - Get session history for store
- `POST /api/pos/order` - Quick order creation (minimal customer data)
- `GET /api/pos/products/search` - Fast product search (barcode, SKU, name)
- `GET /api/pos/products/barcode/:code` - Lookup product by barcode/SKU
- `GET /api/pos/categories` - Get categories for store
- `GET /api/pos/dashboard` - pos dashboard data (today's sales, orders)
- `POST /api/pos/receipt/:orderId` - Generate receipt data
- `POST /api/pos/verify-password` - Verify user password for sensitive actions (price override, discounts)

---

#### [NEW] [barcode.controller.ts](file:///Volumes/Drive/Projects/BitBucket/infi-commerce/backend/src/controllers/barcode.controller.ts)

Barcode management endpoints:
- `POST /api/admin/barcode/generate` - Generate barcode image from SKU
- `POST /api/admin/barcode/bulk-generate` - Bulk generate barcodes
- `GET /api/admin/barcode/download/:productId` - Download barcode PDF
- `POST /api/admin/barcode/print-batch` - Generate printable barcode sheet

