### pos App - Key Features

#### 1. Touch-Optimized Product Browser
- Large touch targets (min 48x48px)
- Category tabs with swipe navigation
- Product cards with one-tap add to cart
- **Variant Selection**: Modal opens for variable products to select attributes
- Grid view with 3-4 products per row
- Image-first design with large product photos
- Quick quantity modifier (+/- buttons)

#### 2. Barcode Scanner Integration
- **Camera Scanner**: Use device camera via `html5-qrcode` library
- **USB Scanner**: Capture USB barcode scanner input (keyboard wedge)
- **Bluetooth Scanner**: Optional Bluetooth scanner support
- **Auto-add to cart logic**:
  - For **non-variable products**: Automatically add to cart with quantity 1 (no modal, instant add)
  - For **variable products**: Open variant selection modal to choose attributes
  - This enables seamless barcode scanning workflow without manual clicks
- Visual/audio feedback on scan

#### 3. Quick Checkout Flow
```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Scan/Select Products] --> B[Review Cart]
    B --> C[Select Payment]
    C --> D{Customer Optional}
    D -->|Skip| E[Complete Sale]
    D -->|Add| F[Enter Details]
    F --> E
    E --> G[Print Receipt]
```

#### 4. Cart Management
- Floating cart panel (right side)
- Swipe to remove items
- Quantity editing
- **Price Override** (requires password re-authentication)
  - Click "Edit Price" button on cart item
  - Enter new price in modal
  - Requires user password confirmation
  - Logs override action with user ID and timestamp
- **Apply Discount** (requires password re-authentication)
  - Percentage or fixed amount discount
  - Can apply to individual items or entire cart
  - Requires user password confirmation before applying
  - Logs discount action with user ID and reason
- Apply coupon codes (automatic validation)
- Split payment support

#### 5. Payment Options
- Cash (with change calculator)
  - **Round-off support**: If enabled in settings, round total to nearest whole number
  - Display round-off amount separately on receipt (e.g., "Round-off: +₹0.50")
  - Automatically calculate exact change based on rounded total
- Card (integrated or manual)
- UPI (QR code display)
- Split payment (multiple methods)

#### 6. Receipt Printing
- **Browser Print**: Default via `window.print()`
- **Thermal Printer**: ESC/POS commands via WebUSB
- **Star Printer**: Star WebPRNT SDK
- **Network Printer**: IP-based printing
- Receipt customization (header, footer, logo)

#### 7. Session Management
- Start shift with opening cash
- End shift with closing cash count
- Cash variance calculation
- Daily sales summary
- Order history export

#### 8. Store Branding
- Store logo display
- Store name in header
- Branded receipt
- Color theme from store settings

---

### Additional Features (Feature-Rich Enhancements)

#### 1. Hold Orders
- Save order for later
- Recall held orders
- Maximum 10 held orders

#### 2. Customer Loyalty
- Quick customer lookup by phone
- View customer purchase history
- Apply loyalty discounts

#### 3. Returns & Exchanges
- Process returns from pos
- Refund via **Cash**, **Bank Transfer**, or **UPI** (No store credit)
- Exchange items logic

#### 4. Product Quick Actions
- View product details modal
- Check stock levels
- View recent price changes

#### 5. Offline Mode
- Cache products for offline use
- Queue orders when offline
- Sync when back online

#### 6. Keyboard Shortcuts
- **"/" (Forward Slash)**: Focus search bar
- **F1-F10**: Quick functions (defined by admin)
- **Cmd/Ctrl + P**: Print receipt
- **Cmd/Ctrl + Enter**: Complete payment & Print receipt (Fast Finish)
- **Esc**: Cancel / Close modal
- **Numpad**: Quantity entry

#### 7. Reports
- Real-time sales dashboard
- Hourly sales chart
- Top selling products (today)
- Payment method breakdown

#### 8. Staff Permissions
- Override price (requires password re-authentication)
- Void order (requires password re-authentication)
- Apply discounts (requires password re-authentication)
- View reports

---

## Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: Backend Foundation
1. Update Store model with pos settings
2. Create pos Session model
3. Update Order model for pos orders
4. Implement pos API endpoints
5. Implement Barcode generation service

### Phase 2: Admin Panel Updates
1. Add pos settings page to store management
2. Add barcode generation to product form
3. Create bulk barcode generator page
4. Add pos sessions viewing

### Phase 3: pos Application Core
1. Create pos Next.js application
2. Implement login and authentication
3. Build touch-optimized product grid
4. Create cart management
5. Implement quick checkout flow

### Phase 4: Barcode & Receipt
1. Integrate barcode scanner (camera + USB)
2. Implement receipt generation
3. Add printer integration
4. Test with actual hardware

### Phase 5: Advanced Features
1. Session management (start/end shift)
2. Hold orders functionality
3. Returns processing
4. Offline mode
5. Reporting dashboard

